  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 1, 'Send a friend a short check-in text today and add, "No need to reply, just thinking of you."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 2, 'Ask one friend, "How are you, really?" and give them your full attention while they answer.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 3, 'Think of a friend going through something hard right now, and write their name on a sticky note where you will see it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 4, 'Instead of saying "let me know if you need anything," offer a friend one specific thing, like "Can I drop off dinner Thursday?"'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 5, 'Put the date of a friend''s upcoming medical appointment, interview or hard anniversary in your calendar with a reminder.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 6, 'When a friend shares something painful today, resist offering a fix and say, "That sounds really hard."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 7, 'Celebrate a friend''s recent good news with a message that names exactly what they did and why it matters.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 8, 'Ask a friend what kind of support feels best to them right now: advice, distraction, company or just listening.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 9, 'Drop off a small treat at a friend''s door, like their favorite snack or a coffee, with a short note.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 10, 'When a friend tells you about a struggle, notice the urge to share your own similar story and keep the focus on them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 11, 'Text a friend who has gone quiet lately with a simple, "I miss you. Here whenever you feel like talking."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 12, 'Offer to run one errand for a friend who is stretched thin, like picking up a prescription or groceries.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 13, 'Make a short list of three friends you want to show up for more, and choose one small action for each.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 14, 'If a friend ever talks about not wanting to live or seems in danger, stay with them if you can and call or text 988 together, or call 911 in an emergency. Save 988 in your phone today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 15, 'Follow up with a friend about something they mentioned last time you talked, and ask how it turned out.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 16, 'Spend ten minutes with a friend, in person or on the phone, without trying to cheer them up or solve anything.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 17, 'If a friend says no to your offer of help today, thank them for telling you and leave the door open without pushing.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 18, 'Write down one thing that keeps you steady, like sleep, a walk or quiet time, so you have the energy to keep showing up for others.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 19, 'Send a friend a photo or memory of a good time you shared, with a line about why you thought of them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 20, 'Ask a friend who is caring for a parent or partner how they are doing, not just how the person they care for is doing.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 21, 'Offer to watch a friend''s kids for an hour so they can rest, run errands or just have a quiet cup of coffee.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 22, 'Before you visit a friend who is having a hard time, ask whether they want company today or would rather you came another day.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 23, 'Mail a handwritten card to a friend who is going through something hard, even if it only says, "I am in your corner."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 24, 'When a friend vents today, reflect back what you heard in one sentence before you say anything else.'),
