  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 28, 'Ask a friend going through a breakup if they want to talk about it or would rather do something that takes their mind off it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 29, 'Show up in person for a friend today if you can, even for a short walk or a quick coffee.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 30, 'Notice if you have been waiting for a friend to reach out first, and send the message yourself today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 31, 'Ask a friend who just lost a job what would help most this week: leads, a résumé read, or a night out that has nothing to do with work.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 32, 'Bring a friend with a new baby a ready-to-eat meal and leave it at the door without expecting to come in.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 33, 'Keep a note on your phone of friends'' important dates, like birthdays, surgeries and anniversaries, and add one today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 34, 'Call a friend instead of texting today, and let the conversation go wherever they want it to.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 35, 'When a friend apologizes for "being a downer," tell them plainly that you want to hear how they really are.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 36, 'Offer to help a friend who is moving with one concrete task, like packing a kitchen or carrying boxes on Saturday morning.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 37, 'Say the name of a friend''s loved one who died when you talk with them, so they know you remember.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 38, 'Check back in with a friend a day or two after a heavy conversation and ask how they are feeling now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 39, 'Ask a friend who is ill whether they would like visitors, phone calls, texts or quiet, and honor their answer.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 40, 'Send a friend a song, a funny video or a short poem that you think will lift their day, with no strings attached.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 41, 'Sit beside a friend who is upset and let a silence last a little longer than feels comfortable.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 42, 'If a friend has been struggling for a long time, gently ask whether they have thought about talking with a counselor or therapist.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 43, 'Offer to do a load of dishes, fold laundry or tidy one room while you visit a friend who is overwhelmed.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 44, 'Text a friend on the morning of a big interview, test or appointment to say you are thinking of them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 45, 'After a friend''s big event, ask how it went and listen to the whole story, good parts and hard parts.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 46, 'Replace "I know exactly how you feel" with "I can only imagine, tell me more" the next time a friend opens up.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 47, 'Plan a low-key hangout with a friend who has been isolating, like a walk, a movie at home or takeout on the couch.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 48, 'Take one small step to recharge today, like a nap or a quiet walk, so you have something to give when friends need you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 49, 'Ask a grieving friend to tell you a favorite story about the person they lost, and listen to all of it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 50, 'Ask a friend what the hardest part of their week has been and let them answer without interruption.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 51, 'Cheer for a friend''s small win today, like a good day at physical therapy or a first full night of sleep with a new baby.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 52, 'Offer to sit in the waiting room with a friend during a medical appointment or procedure.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 53, 'Write down what a friend told you about their situation so you can remember the details and ask about them later.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 54, 'Let a friend know you are free on a specific evening this week if they want company, and name the time.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 55, 'When a friend chooses something you would not, like staying in a job or a relationship, listen without arguing.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 56, 'Pick up a few groceries for a friend who is sick, and ask for their list rather than guessing.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 57, 'Ask a friend who is a new parent how they are sleeping and offer to take a shift so they can nap.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 58, 'Send a friend a voice message today, so they can hear your voice even if they cannot talk.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 59, 'Invite a friend who has been withdrawing to something easy to say yes to, like a short drive or picking up coffee together.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 60, 'Thank a friend for trusting you with something hard they told you, and keep it to yourself.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 61, 'Make an extra portion of what you are cooking tonight and bring it to a friend who could use a night off.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 62, 'Offer to make phone calls a friend has been dreading, like to an insurer or a landlord, if they would like the help.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 63, 'Ask a friend who is grieving how they would like an anniversary or holiday handled: together, separately or not mentioned.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 64, 'Say "I am sorry this is happening" to a friend without adding "but" or "at least."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 65, 'Look back over the friends you have reached out to so far in this challenge and notice who you have not checked on yet.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 66, 'Write a friend a short list of three things you value about them and send it today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 67, 'If a friend cancels plans, reply kindly, tell them there is no pressure, and suggest another time later.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 68, 'Offer to go with a friend to something they are nervous about, like a support group, a court date or a first day back.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 69, 'Find out from a struggling friend what a good day would look like for them right now, and help make one part of it happen.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 70, 'Before giving a friend advice today, ask whether they want it, and accept it if they say no.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 71, 'Set a reminder to check in with a friend one week after a funeral, a diagnosis or a breakup, when the cards usually stop coming.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 72, 'Tell a friend you are proud of them for something they did that took courage.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 73, 'Notice your own limits today and tell a friend honestly what you can offer, rather than promising more than you can give.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 74, 'Ask a friend about something they love, like a hobby or a show, to give them a break from talking about what is hard.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 75, 'Write a friend a note to open on a hard day, and give it to them to keep.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 76, 'Offer to walk a friend''s dog or feed their pets during a week that is overwhelming for them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 77, 'Offer a grieving friend help with one thank-you task, like addressing envelopes or returning borrowed dishes.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 78, 'Take over one regular task for a friend caring for a sick relative, like a weekly pharmacy run, if they would welcome it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 79, 'When a friend shares good news, ask a follow-up question about it before you share any of your own news.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 80, 'Plan a small celebration for a friend''s milestone, like a finished treatment, a new job or a year in a new city.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 81, 'Hold your phone face down while a friend is talking to you in person, so they know they have your attention.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 82, 'Ask a friend who is going through a divorce if they would like help with one practical thing, like packing or finding a phone number.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 83, 'Reply to a friend''s long, hard message with a thoughtful response, even if it takes you a few tries to write.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 84, 'Offer to keep a friend company while they do a dreaded chore, like sorting mail or filling out forms.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 85, 'Remind a friend who is struggling that they do not have to reply to you, return calls or be good company right now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 86, 'Arrange with two or three other friends to take turns bringing meals to someone who is ill or grieving.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 87, 'Ask a friend who has a new baby what they miss doing, and help them find an hour to do it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 88, 'Remember a friend''s coffee or tea order and bring it to them on a stressful morning.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 89, 'When you visit a sick friend, keep the visit short unless they ask you to stay longer.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 90, 'Check in with a friend on a day that is usually lonely, like a Sunday evening or a holiday they spend alone.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 91, 'Tell a friend who is struggling, in your own words, that they are not a burden to you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 92, 'Offer to help a friend find a counselor, sit with them while they make the call, or drive them to the first appointment.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 93, 'Notice if you are telling a friend''s hard news to others, and keep their story theirs to tell.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 94, 'Send a friend who is job hunting one lead, contact or opening that fits what they want.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 95, 'Ask a friend who has moved recently how they are settling in, and offer to help unpack one box or hang pictures.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 96, 'Write down one way a friend showed up for you in the past, and look for a chance to return it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 97, 'Show up for a friend''s event, like a recital, a game, a reading or a gallery night, and tell them you came.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 98, 'Ask a friend who is caregiving if they have eaten today, and bring them something if they have not.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 99, 'Leave a kind voicemail for a friend who never answers the phone, with no request for a callback.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 100, 'When a friend is angry about their situation, let them be angry without telling them to calm down or look on the bright side.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 101, 'Find out which days are hardest for a friend who is ill, like treatment days, and check in on those days.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 102, 'Pick one friend to keep in mind all day today, and act on any small chance to help them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 103, 'Tell a friend that you noticed how hard they have been working on something, even if it has not paid off yet.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 104, 'Offer to help a friend tidy up before or after they host a gathering they are dreading.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 105, 'Ask a friend who just went through a breakup if they want company on a night that used to belong to the relationship.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 106, 'Think about one friend whose struggle you may have missed, and send them a warm message today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 107, 'Tell one person in your own life what you are carrying while supporting a friend, so you are not holding it all alone.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 108, 'Let a friend who is grieving know they can talk about their person with you any time, and mean it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 109, 'Send a friend a short message the evening after a hard appointment, asking how they are holding up.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 110, 'Avoid comparing a friend''s situation to anyone else''s today, even to say it could be worse.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 111, 'Help a friend write a hard email or message they have been avoiding, if they ask for help.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 112, 'Offer to take a friend''s car for an oil change, a wash or a repair, so it is one less thing on their list.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 113, 'Ask a friend which kinds of help have actually been useful lately, and do more of that.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 114, 'Ask a friend about one small part of their day, like what they ate or what made them smile, and stay curious about it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 115, 'Send a friend a short encouraging note on their first day back at work after a loss, an illness or a leave.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 116, 'Drop off flowers from your yard or a simple grocery store bouquet at the home of a friend who is having a hard week.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 117, 'If a friend says they want to be alone, respect it, and send one text later saying you are still around.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 118, 'Ask a friend who is pregnant or newly a parent how they are feeling, beyond questions about the baby.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 119, 'Gently tell a friend you are worried about them, using "I" statements like "I have noticed you seem worn down."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 120, 'Help a friend with a technology chore, like setting up a new phone or sorting out a bill online.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 121, 'Keep the weekend after a friend''s surgery clear, so you can bring food or sit with them if they want.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 122, 'Listen to a friend tell the same hard story again without saying, "You told me that already."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 123, 'Invite a friend who is struggling to join you for something you were already doing, like a grocery run or a dog walk.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 124, 'Ask a friend who is out of work how they are feeling about it, not just how the job search is going.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 125, 'Write a friend a congratulations card for a milestone and mail it, so they have something to keep.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 126, 'Accept that you cannot fix a friend''s situation, and write down one small thing you can still do.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 127, 'Ask a friend after a hard week whether they would like you to come over, go out with them or just call.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 128, 'Bring a friend who is sick a simple care package, like tissues, tea, crackers and a book.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 129, 'Ask a friend who has been through something hard what they wish more people understood about it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 130, 'Send a friend a message on a holiday that might be hard for them, like Mother''s Day or Father''s Day after a loss.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 131, 'Avoid saying "Everything happens for a reason" to a friend who is hurting, and say "I am here" instead.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 132, 'Bring snacks and drinks to a friend''s moving day so the people helping have something to keep them going.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 133, 'Let a friend cry without handing them a tissue right away or telling them it will be okay.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 134, 'Tell a friend you would like to stay in touch on a regular rhythm while things are hard, like a call every other Sunday, and set it up.'),
