  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 136, 'Ask a friend if there is anyone else you could help them reach out to, like a sibling or another friend, so they have more support.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 137, 'Notice the friend who is always the helper, and ask them how they are doing for a change.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 138, 'Send a friend who is having a hard week a short message every day for three days, just to say you are around.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 139, 'Before mentioning a friend''s hard news to anyone, ask whether they would like you to tell others or keep it private.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 140, 'Help a friend with yard work, snow shoveling or a household repair they cannot get to right now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 141, 'Look back over this challenge so far and notice which ways of showing up felt most natural for you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 142, 'Introduce a friend who has just moved to your area to one person you think they would like.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 143, 'Help a friend who has had a hard year plan something they are looking forward to, like a trip or a day off.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 144, 'Offer to help a friend sort through paperwork after a loss or a layoff, like forms, bills or benefits.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 145, 'Be on time when you have said you will show up for a friend, so they can count on you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 146, 'If a friend tells you something worrying about their safety at home, listen, believe them and ask how you can help them stay safe.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 147, 'Ask a friend if they would like to take a short walk with you, and let them set the pace and the topic.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 148, 'Offer to be the person a friend calls after a hard appointment, and keep your phone on for them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 149, 'Watch a favorite movie with a friend who needs comfort, in person or at the same time from separate homes.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 150, 'Ask a friend whether there is a date coming up that they are dreading, and note it so you can reach out.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 151, 'Say yes to a friend''s request for help today if you can, without making them explain or justify it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 152, 'Tell a friend one thing you learned from watching them get through something hard.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 153, 'Bring a friend who has been in the hospital a meal they can freeze for later.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 154, 'Offer to sit with a friend''s loved one for an afternoon so your friend can rest or go out.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 155, 'Text a friend after you see something that made you think of them, and tell them what it was.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 156, 'Ask a friend who seems stressed whether they have had any fun lately, and suggest something easy you could do together.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 157, 'Write out a few gentle phrases you can use when you do not know what to say, like "I am here" or "That is so unfair."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 158, 'Offer a friend who is overwhelmed a quiet place to stay for a night, like your guest room or couch.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 159, 'Read aloud to a friend who is too tired or sick to read, or pick a podcast to listen to together.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 160, 'Plan a phone date with a friend who lives far away and is going through something hard.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 161, 'Toast a friend''s good news at your next meal together, out loud, so they hear how happy you are for them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 162, 'Ask a friend who has just started a new job how the first days felt, and listen for both the excitement and the nerves.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 163, 'Hold back from posting about a friend''s hard news online unless they have said it is okay.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 164, 'Drive a friend''s kids to school or activities for a morning so they have one less trip to make.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 165, 'Check on a friend who is a single parent and ask if there is a chore or errand you can take off their plate.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 166, 'Offer a friend going through a breakup help with a practical task, like changing passwords or returning belongings.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 167, 'Bring a friend in a hard season a small plant, a candle or a cozy pair of socks.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 168, 'When a friend repeats a worry, answer with patience, and ask what feels most worrying today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 169, 'Give a friend a hug if they want one, and ask first if you are not sure.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 170, 'Tell a friend in plain words, "I love you, and I am not going anywhere."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 171, 'Ask a friend after a funeral how they are sleeping and eating, and offer one small thing to help.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 172, 'Invite a friend who is grieving to a quiet activity, like a drive or a walk near water, without needing to talk.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 173, 'Learn a little about a friend''s illness from a reliable source, so they do not have to explain the basics to you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 174, 'Ask a friend about their medical news only when they bring it up, and let them choose how much to share.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 175, 'Ask a friend to teach you something they love, to give them a chance to feel capable on a hard day.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 176, 'Make a plan with a friend to do one ordinary thing together, like laundry or meal prep, so they are not alone with it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 177, 'Notice when you feel worn out from supporting someone, and take a short break without feeling guilty.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 178, 'Offer to help a friend look for a new place to live, like touring an apartment with them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 179, 'Respond with kindness first when a friend tells you about a mistake they made.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 180, 'Ask a friend whose health limits their energy what an easy hangout would look like, and plan that.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 181, 'Pay attention to a friend''s body language today, and gently ask if they are okay if something seems off.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 182, 'Go along with a friend to a hard place if they ask, like a cemetery, an old home or a hospital where something happened.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 183, 'Remind a friend of a hard thing they already got through, and tell them you believe in them now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 184, 'Ask a friend who is planning a wedding, a move or a new baby where they feel stressed, and offer one hand.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 185, 'Say "Take your time" to a friend who is slow to respond, and mean it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 186, 'When a friend turns down an invitation, keep inviting them now and then, with no pressure.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 187, 'Help a friend clean out a fridge, a closet or a car that has gotten away from them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 188, 'Offer to cover a friend''s shift, a carpool or a volunteer duty when they are dealing with something hard.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 189, 'Be the friend who remembers: ask about a friend''s sister, pet or project by name today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 190, 'Mail a friend who lives far away a small box with a note and a few things from home.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 191, 'Ask a friend who is facing a big decision if they want help thinking it through, and ask questions instead of steering.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 192, 'Tell a friend you are glad they told you about something hard, even if it was hard for you to hear.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 193, 'Offer to proofread a friend''s résumé, cover letter or application before they send it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 194, 'Text a friend with a new baby in the middle of the afternoon, when the day can feel longest, just to say hello.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 195, 'Celebrate a friend''s birthday in a way that fits them, quiet or loud, and make sure they feel remembered.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 196, 'Offer to be in the room with a friend for a big moment, like signing papers or making a hard phone call.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 197, 'Avoid telling a friend what you would do in their place unless they ask you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 198, 'Check in with a friend''s partner or family, with your friend''s okay, to see what would help the household.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 199, 'Ask a friend what made them laugh this week, to give them a lighter moment in a heavy time.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 200, 'Share a meal with a friend who has been eating alone a lot, at your place, theirs or out.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 201, 'Bring a friend a book, a puzzle or a game to pass the time while they recover.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 202, 'If a friend talks about feeling hopeless or trapped, ask them directly whether they are thinking about suicide, stay with them, and call or text 988 together.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 203, 'Ask a friend how their body is feeling after a surgery, a birth or a long illness, and listen without rushing.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 204, 'Offer to take photos at a friend''s milestone, like a graduation or a first day, so they can be in the pictures.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 205, 'Remember a friend''s tough anniversary by doing something in honor of their loved one, and tell them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 206, 'Send a friend a short, honest apology if you missed a moment when they needed you, and ask how they are now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 207, 'Cheer on a friend after a breakup for anything they are doing for themselves, like a class, a haircut or a new routine.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 208, 'Take a friend out for an hour of something fun after a long stretch of hard news.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 209, 'Sit with a grieving friend while they look through photos, and let them tell you about each one.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 210, 'Tell a friend you noticed they seemed lighter today, and that it was good to see.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 211, 'Ask a friend who is new to caregiving which questions they are stuck on, and help look up answers.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 212, 'Let a friend who is struggling choose where to meet and what to do, so they feel in control of something.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 213, 'Ask a friend how they would like you to check in during a hard stretch: daily texts, weekly calls or only when they reach out.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 214, 'Help a friend practice what they want to say before a hard conversation with a boss, a parent or an ex.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 215, 'Bring up something you are both excited about to give a struggling friend something to look forward to.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 216, 'Remember the date a friend started something brave, like a new job or a new city, and mark it a year later with a message.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 217, 'Notice whether you are giving advice to feel useful, and try simply listening instead today.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 218, 'Ask a friend who has lost a pet how they are doing, and say the pet''s name.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 219, 'Take a slow breath before answering a friend in distress, so you can respond calmly.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 220, 'Check on a friend after a pregnancy loss or during a hard pregnancy, and let them guide the conversation.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 221, 'Offer a friend who is between jobs a practice interview over coffee.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 222, 'Send a friend a message the night before a big move, saying you are proud of them for taking it on.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 223, 'Ask a friend how their partner or kids are doing too, when the whole family is going through something.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 224, 'Tell a friend you will check on them again next week, then do it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 225, 'Offer a friend a standing favor for a hard season, like grocery pickup every Saturday, and keep it going.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 226, 'Make a friend laugh with an old inside joke when they seem to need a lift.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 227, 'Ask a friend about a plan they had before things got hard, and whether they want help picking it back up.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 228, 'Visit a friend in a nursing home, rehab center or hospital, even for twenty minutes.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 229, 'Clean up after a meal at a friend''s house without being asked.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 230, 'Help a friend who is newly single set up something of their own, like a room, a new routine or a solo trip plan.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 231, 'Speak up kindly when someone gossips about a friend who is going through a hard time.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 232, 'Choose a set day each month to call one friend who is going through something long, and write it down.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 233, 'Tell a friend who is overwhelmed that it is okay to drop something, and help them decide what can wait.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 234, 'Ask a friend with new health news if they want someone to take notes at their next appointment.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 235, 'Notice if you are avoiding a friend because their pain is uncomfortable for you, and reach out anyway.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 236, 'Bring a friend a ready-made breakfast on a morning after a long night at the hospital or with a baby.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 237, 'Help a friend find a few minutes of quiet, like taking the kids outside or answering the door for them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 238, 'Tell a friend in a short message that you believe they will get through this, and why.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 239, 'Water a friend''s plants, collect their mail or feed their cat while they are away for a family emergency.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 240, 'When a friend tells you their plans have fallen apart, ask how they are feeling before talking about next steps.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 241, 'Go to a friend''s first event in a new venture, like an opening night or a first market stall, and bring someone along.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 242, 'Suggest a shared list of things a friend needs, so the people who want to help can pitch in.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 243, 'Tell a friend about a time you needed help, if it will make them feel less alone, and keep it short.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 244, 'Notice a friend''s practical need without being told, like an empty fridge or a full sink, and quietly take care of it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 245, 'Ask a friend who is struggling whether they would like to make a small plan together for tomorrow.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 246, 'Look up respite care or local services for a friend who is caregiving, if they want help finding options.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 247, 'Ask a friend who seems upset, "Do you want to talk about it, or do you want company?"'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 248, 'Tell a friend who is hard on themselves one kind thing you see in them that they might not see.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 249, 'Treat a friend who is out of work to a simple outing, so money is not the reason they stay home.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 250, 'Spend time with a friend doing nothing in particular, like sitting on a porch or in a parked car.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 251, 'Respect a friend''s wish to handle something on their own, and say you are proud of them for trying.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 252, 'Ask a friend who is far from family whether they have plans for a holiday, and invite them if they do not.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 253, 'Ask a friend in a busy season when is a good time to reach them, and plan your calls around it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 254, 'Bring a friend who is working long hours through a crisis a bag of easy snacks for their car or desk.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 255, 'Notice a friend who just went through something hard but is not talking about it, and send a gentle note with no questions.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 256, 'Offer to walk with a friend who wants to start moving more after an illness or a hard stretch.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 257, 'Find a practical, low-key way to help a friend who is short on money, without making it awkward.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 258, 'Mark the end of a friend''s hard stretch with something simple, like a dinner, a toast or a walk to a favorite spot.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 259, 'When a friend says "I''m fine" and you are not sure, say "Okay, I am here if that changes."'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 260, 'Return a friend''s call within a day, even if just to say you will call properly later.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 261, 'Invite a friend who is caregiving to tell you one good moment from their week.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 262, 'Offer to drive a friend somewhere just to get out of the house, with no destination required.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 263, 'Write a friend a few lines on paper to tuck into a hospital bag, a suitcase or a lunch box.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 264, 'Remember that you are not a friend''s only support, and let that ease some of the pressure you feel.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 265, 'Ask a friend who has had a rough month if they would like help planning one restful day.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 266, 'Ask a friend who is using crutches, a cane or a wheelchair after an injury which places are easiest to meet, and plan around that.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 267, 'Ask a friend what is giving them a little hope right now, and listen closely.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 268, 'Help a friend celebrate a promotion or a new job by asking what they are most proud of.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 269, 'Write down one thing you will do differently the next time a friend comes to you upset.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 270, 'Remind a friend after a breakup of the people and things that are still theirs, like their friends, their hobbies and their humor.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 271, 'Reach out to a friend''s roommate, partner or sibling if you are worried and cannot reach your friend for a while.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 272, 'Invite a friend with young kids to a get-together where kids are welcome, so they do not need a sitter.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 273, 'Bring up a happy memory with a friend whose life feels heavy, and laugh about it together.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 274, 'Listen to a friend''s voice message all the way through before replying, and respond to what they actually said.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 275, 'Ask a friend whether they would like you to check in about a goal they set, like a walk each day or a job application a week.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 276, 'Notice how a friend reacts when you offer help, and adjust if they seem embarrassed or pressured.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 277, 'Give a friend who is caregiving ten minutes to vent, with no advice from you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 278, 'Leave a short note of support where a friend will find it, like on their car or their desk.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 279, 'Video call a friend who lives far away while you both cook dinner or fold laundry.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 280, 'Avoid saying "You should" to a friend today, and ask "What are you thinking of doing?" instead.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 281, 'Give a friend who is grieving a small keepsake, like a framed photo or a printed copy of a message from their loved one.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 282, 'Take a friend to a favorite spot of theirs, like a beach, a park or a diner, on a hard anniversary.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 283, 'Offer to stay overnight with a friend on a night they do not want to be alone, like after a funeral or a breakup.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 284, 'When a friend shares something big, put down what you are doing and turn toward them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 285, 'Ask a friend who is changing careers what part of the change excites them most.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 286, 'Plan a first outing with a friend who has been stuck at home, like a short drive or coffee at a quiet place.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 287, 'Ask a friend how you have been doing as a support lately, and listen to the answer without defending yourself.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 288, 'Help a friend make a simple meal plan for a busy or hard week, and cook one dish with them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 289, 'Tell a friend that it is okay to cancel on you anytime, so they never feel guilty when they need rest.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 290, 'Ask a friend in a hard season if there is a small treat they have been wanting, and surprise them with it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 291, 'Make some of the phone calls a friend dreads after a loss, letting people know, if they want you to.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 292, 'When a friend is short with you while under stress, stay calm and come back to the conversation later.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 293, 'Invite a friend to join you in something you already do to feel good, like a stretching class or a weekly hike.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 294, 'Text a friend a question that is easy to answer, like "What are you having for dinner?" to keep the line open.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 295, 'Keep a promise you made to a friend, even a small one like returning a book or sending a link.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 296, 'Hold the baby so a friend who is a new parent can shower or eat in peace.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 297, 'Tell a friend who is going through a hard time that their feelings make sense.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 298, 'Bring a friend a meal in a container they do not have to return.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 299, 'Ask a friend who is recovering from surgery which household task is hardest right now, and do it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 300, 'Send a friend who is caring for a dying relative a message that you are holding them in your thoughts, and ask if they want company.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 301, 'Find out what helped most during a friend''s long hard stretch, and write it down for next time.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 302, 'Ask a friend what song gets them through hard days, and listen to it yourself.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 303, 'Notice when a friend changes the subject away from something painful, and let them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 304, 'Offer a friend who is moving after a breakup or a loss help packing up the things that are hard to touch.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 305, 'Ask a friend who is raising a teenager through a rough patch how they themselves are holding up.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 306, 'Tell a friend you are happy to be the one who plans the next get-together, so they do not have to.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 307, 'Wave off a friend''s apology for being slow to reply, and tell them nobody is keeping score between you.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 308, 'Make a friend a simple playlist for a hard drive, a long night or a hospital stay.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 309, 'Help a friend set up a quiet corner at home for rest or recovery, with pillows, a lamp and things within reach.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 310, 'Send a friend a postcard from a place you visited, telling them you thought of them there.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 311, 'Let a friend who is new to a city show you their neighborhood, so they get to be the expert.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 312, 'Let a friend who is hurting know that there is no timeline for feeling better.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 313, 'Encourage a struggling friend to take one small comfort they keep skipping, like a bath or a walk.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 314, 'Remind a friend of an upcoming appointment if they asked you to help them keep track.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 315, 'Stay neutral and kind when a friend tells you about a fight with a partner or family member, and listen for how they feel.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 316, 'Bring a friend who is stuck at home something from the outside world, like a bakery treat or a story from your day.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 317, 'Listen for hurt when a grieving friend tells you how other people have been treating them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 318, 'Ask a friend who seems short-tempered lately whether everything is okay, instead of taking it personally.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 319, 'Write down three things a friend is looking forward to and ask about each one over the coming weeks.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 320, 'Help a friend in the middle of a big change notice what is staying the same.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 321, 'Bring a friend some fresh air if they cannot get out: open a window, bring flowers or take them for a slow stroll.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 322, 'Offer a friend who just had a baby a visit now or a few weeks from now, whichever suits them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 323, 'Thank a friend who supported you through something hard, and ask how you can show up for them now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 324, 'Offer to handle the logistics for a friend''s celebration, like booking a table or sending invitations.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 325, 'Sit down with a friend in a legal or money crisis and help them list next steps, if they want that.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 326, 'Send a quick check-in to a friend whose hard news you heard secondhand, without asking for details.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 327, 'Ask a friend who is lonely to call you when they get home tonight, so their evening has a voice in it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 328, 'Tell a friend what you appreciate about how they show up for others, since helpers often go unnoticed.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 329, 'Pick an ordinary weekday to tell a friend one specific reason you are glad they are in your life.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 330, 'Keep 988 saved in your phone, and remember it is there for you too if supporting a friend in crisis becomes too much to carry.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 331, 'Talk with a friend who has had a hard year about what they would like to leave behind as the new year starts.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 332, 'Offer to join a friend for a hard first, like the first holiday after a divorce or the first trip back to a hometown.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 333, 'If a friend''s struggles seem to be getting heavier over time, tell them gently that a counselor could help, and that you will support them either way.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 334, 'Send a friend a message after a tough family gathering, asking how it went and how they are feeling.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 335, 'Ask a friend whose plans were canceled by illness or bad news whether they want to reschedule together.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 336, 'Make room in your week for a friend who is going through a hard time, even if it means saying no to something else.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 337, 'Ask a friend who is newly retired, newly an empty nester or newly widowed how their days feel now.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 338, 'Remind a friend who seems embarrassed about needing help of a time they helped you, so it feels like a fair trade.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 339, 'Celebrate one thing a worn-out friend did for themselves this week, after asking what it was.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 340, 'When you cannot be there in person, send something that shows up for you, like a meal delivery or a handwritten letter.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 341, 'Tell a friend who is grieving that you still think of their loved one, months or years later.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 342, 'Ask a friend whose good news is mixed with hard feelings, like a new job far away, about both sides.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 343, 'Write down what you have learned about being a good friend during this challenge, and share one line of it with a friend.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 344, 'Find out what a friend needs more of next week after a hard one, and help with one piece of it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 345, 'Ride along with a friend on a long drive to see family, a doctor or a new home.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 346, 'Notice a friend who has been celebrating everyone else, and celebrate them for a change.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 347, 'Ask a friend who is in a new role, like a new manager or a new parent, what is surprising them most.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 348, 'Sit beside a friend during a hard moment at a gathering, like a toast to someone they lost.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 349, 'Bring a friend a meal and stay to eat it with them, if they would like company.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 350, 'Notice how a friend is doing a few months after a breakup or a loss, and ask how this season compares to the last.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 351, 'Ask a friend who is waiting on results or news how they are passing the time, and offer to wait with them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 352, 'Admit to a friend when you got something wrong while trying to help, and ask what would work better.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 353, 'Ask a friend what tradition or routine they want to keep through a hard season, and help them keep it.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 354, 'Give a friend credit in front of others for getting through something hard, if they are comfortable with that.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 355, 'Ask a friend whose loved one is in the hospital whether they need someone to bring them clean clothes or a charger.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 356, 'Make plans with a friend for a day that might feel empty, like the first weekend after a move or a breakup.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 357, 'Listen with respect when a friend shares how something hard has changed their outlook.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 358, 'Help a friend who is feeling stronger after a long illness do one thing they have been looking forward to.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 359, 'Tell a friend that you are glad they reached out, every time they do.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 360, 'Ask a friend whose family lives far away who will be with them for a hard event, and offer to be one of them.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 361, 'Write down the names of friends you have shown up for during this challenge, and notice how many there are.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 362, 'Reach out today to the friend you thought of first when you read this, and ask how they are doing.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 363, 'Choose one way of showing up from this challenge to keep doing, and put a recurring reminder in your calendar.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 364, 'Tell a friend you plan to keep showing up for them, and name one way you will do it in the coming months.'),
  ('showing-up-for-a-friend', 365, 'Write a short note to yourself about the kind of friend you want to be when life gets hard for someone you love, and keep it where you will see it.')
